text: >-
  Again, and perhaps a minor point, while the indictment has Tyler "turning
  himself in," the Discord

  post has "surrendering." More significant, in our view, is the awkwardness of
  the "willing"

  surrender. It is unnatural for anyone to use such a phrase speaking in the
  first person, but

  makes a lot of sense when we enter the mentality of the fabricator who has at
  one point Tyler

  wanting to go out on his own terms - suggesting to Sam Parker that the initial
  plan was to

  execute Robinson in a shoot out.

